    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>UVDelta 83 (Urgences Vétérinaires Delta 83), in Puget-sur-Argens, is a practice entirely dedicated to veterinary emergencies — not a regular clinic with a few extra on-call hours, but a team organised around resuscitation and intensive care, which presents itself as available 24/7.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>This is the number to keep in mind if something comes up at night, on a weekend or on a public holiday during your stay in the Var — several vets in the area (such as the one in Saint-Raphaël) themselves refer their patients to UVDelta 83 outside their own hours.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: save this number on your phone as soon as you arrive in the Var, even before you need it — in an emergency, every minute counts.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Puget-sur-Argens is right next to Fréjus, easily reached from the motorway.</p>
